s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeWithShreyans/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeWithShreyans/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeWithShreyans/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeWithShreyans/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeWithShreyans/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T18:28:57Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T18:28:57Z","body":"Side question but does ISR work for Server Islands?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2569648511/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2569848841","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/issues/12803#issuecomment-2569848841","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/12803","id":2569848841,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFL76Q86ZLMgJ","user":{"login":"gtom84","id":53334241,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMzM0MjQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53334241?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84","html_url":"https://github.com/gtom84","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T21:36:49Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T21:36:49Z","body":"> Side question but does ISR work for Server Islands?\r\n\r\nVercel says \r\n\r\n> ISR function requests do not include search params, similar to requests in static mode.\r\n\r\nBy this logic it should not because Server Island is loaded with searchParams but the same applies for static build and that works in 5.0.5.\r\n\r\nI tested in the most recent 5.1.2 and still the same results as in originaly reported 5.1.1.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2569848841/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2571151840","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/issues/12803#issuecomment-2571151840","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/12803","id":2571151840,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFL76Q86ZQKng","user":{"login":"Trombach","id":19306765,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzA2NzY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19306765?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach","html_url":"https://github.com/Trombach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-04T10:20:12Z","updated_at":"2025-01-04T10:20:12Z","body":"I've not had time to properly look into the root cause, but the breakage is due to the `astro:build:done` hook not returning the `_server-islands/[name]` route in the (deprecated) `routes` array. Currently the vercel (and probably other adapters too) use this to generate the route config. This should be fixed when https://github.com/withastro/adapters/pull/454 lands, since it moves all adapters to the newer `astro:routes:resolved` hook which I've confirmed works as expected.\r\n\r\nEven though the `routes` parameter in `astro:build:done` is deprecated, it's still a regression and potentially breaks integrations that rely on server island routes being contained in the data. It's a bit of an edge case, that's probably why it slipped through.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2571151840/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2571411113","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/issues/12803#issuecomment-2571411113","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/12803","id":2571411113,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFL76Q86ZRJ6p","user":{"login":"trueberryless","id":99918022,"node_id":"U_kgDOBfSgxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99918022?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueberryless","html_url":"https://github.com/trueberryless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueberryless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueberryless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueberryless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/u