ssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2576135923/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2576204393","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/issues/12803#issuecomment-2576204393","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/12803","id":2576204393,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFL76Q86ZjcJp","user":{"login":"andrijantasevski","id":62153955,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMTUzOTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62153955?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski","html_url":"https://github.com/andrijantasevski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T20:56:05Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T20:59:10Z","body":"> @andrijantasevski can you provide a repro? I've tested locally and 5.1.3 seems to be working fine now\r\n\r\nHere's a repository with a minimal repro:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/andrijantasevski/astro-server-islands\r\n\r\nAstro                    v5.1.3\r\nNode                     v20.9.0\r\nSystem                   Linux (x64)\r\nPackage Manager          pnpm\r\nOutput                   static\r\nAdapter                  @astrojs/node\r\nIntegrations             none","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2576204393/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2576453677","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/issues/12803#issuecomment-2576453677","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/12803","id":2576453677,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFL76Q86ZkZAt","user":{"login":"gtom84","id":53334241,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMzM0MjQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53334241?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84","html_url":"https://github.com/gtom84","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T00:06:04Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T00:06:04Z","body":"> This is working again for me using Astro 5.1.3. Using the vercel adapter\r\n\r\nDoes it work for you if you also enable ISR in Vercel adapter?\r\n\r\nI tested the above minimal repo and it works with Vercel in both `output: static` and `server` but only without ISR.\r\n\r\n```\r\nimport { defineConfig } from 'astro/config';\r\nimport vercel from '@astrojs/vercel';\r\n\r\n// https://astro.build/config\r\nexport default defineConfig({\r\n  output: \"server\",\r\n  adapter: vercel({\r\n    isr: true,   // Server Islands don't work with this line in 5.1.3, returns HTTP/400 Bad request\r\n  }),\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2576453677/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2577054835","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/issues/12803#issuecomment-2577054835","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/12803","id":2577054835,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFL76Q86Zmrxz","user":{"login":"andrijantasevski","id":62153955,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMTUzOTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62153955?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski","html_url":"https://github.com/andrijantasevski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrijantasevski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T08:30:06Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T08:30:34Z","body":"I got server islands to work after tweaking the settings.\n\nWith the node adapter, I had to add the property **output: server** in the astro config file.\n\nI also had to mark the page with the directive **export const prerender = true**.\n\nIt would be great if the documentation could be updated with this information because I thought the compiler knows how to automatically render the islands dynamically without having to explicitly mark the pages as prerender/static.\n\nThe Astro server islands example that is inspired by Next.js PPR needs to be updated as well because it is an older implementation that is based on the hybrid rendering, which I assume doesn't require us to explicitly mark the pages as prerendered with a SSR adapter.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2577054835/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2577184780","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/issues/12803#issuecomment-2577184780","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/12803","id":2577184780,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFL76Q86ZnLgM","user":{"login":"Trombach","id":19306765,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzA2NzY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19306765?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach","html_url":"https://github.com/Trombach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trombach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T09:22:34Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T09:24:20Z","body":"> I got server islands to work after tweaking the settings.\r\n> \r\n> With the node adapter, I had to add the property **output: server** in the astro config file.\r\n> \r\n> I also had to mark the page with the directive **export const prerender = true**.\r\n> \r\n> It would be great if the documentation could be updated with this information because I thought the compiler knows how to automatically render the islands dynamically without having to explicitly mark the pages as prerender/static.\r\n> \r\n> The Astro server islands example that is inspired by Next.js PPR needs to be updated as well because it is an older implementation that is based on the hybrid rendering, which I assume doesn't require us to explicitly mark the pages as prerendered with a SSR adapter.\r\n\r\nYou shouldn't have to do those steps, so that sounds like a bug. I believe the docs are correct.\r\n\r\nI think you're seeing another issue tracked in #12744 \r\n\r\n@gtom84 I'll try to test my page with isr enabled later today","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2577184780/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2577660561","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/issues/12803#issuecomment-2577660561","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/12803","id":2577660561,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFL76Q86Zo_qR","user":{"login":"trueberryless","id":99918022,"node_id":"U_kgDOBfSgxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99918022?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueberryless","html_url":"https://github.com/trueberryless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueberryless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueberryless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueberryless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueberryless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueberryless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueberryless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueberryless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueberryless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueberryless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T13:21:53Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T13:21:53Z","body":"> With the node adapter, I had to add the property **output: server** in the astro config file.\r\n> \r\n> I also had to mark the page with the directive **export const prerender = true**.\r\n\r\nI can confirm that this is also happening in my project, as you can see in [this PR](https://github.com/trueberryless-org/starlight-plugin-show-latest-version/pull/25).\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: I have not looked into #12744, it's probably that issue instead...\r\n\r\nIn order to repro:\r\n\r\n1. Checkout the [`docs-update`](https://github.com/trueberryless-org/starlight-plugin-show-latest-version/tree/docs-update) branch\r\n2. Revert the changes from https://github.com/trueberryless-org/starlight-plugin-show-latest-version/pull/25/commits/da8f1fbe7d3c5017abd9197acd7e85de05a4ab8f (these changes make it possible to work, as @andrijantasevski mentions)\r\n3. `pnpm build` -> `pnpm preview`\r\n4. The badge in the site title should be empty (no version visible) in contrast to the badges you can see here: http://localhost:4321/components#versionbadge\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2577660561/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2577804981","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/issues/12803#issuecomment-2577804981","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/12803","id":2577804981,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFL76Q86Zpi61","user":{"login":"bluwy","id":34116392,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTE2Mzky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34116392?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy","html_url":"https://github.com/bluwy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T14:26:40Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T14:26:40Z","body":"It looks like the issue here is that we're adding the server-island route handler here: https://github.com/withastro/astro/blob/0770810aa458192d1d6f14a51a17504885f67644/packages/astro/src/core/routing/manifest/create.ts#L743-L752\r\n\r\nIt depends on `settings.buildOutput` during build, however that field actually isn't finalized yet when we try to read it. At that point, it returns `\"static\"`. But when running the node adapter, it'll later set it as `\"server\"` here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/withastro/astro/blob/0770810aa458192d1d6f14a51a17504885f67644/packages/astro/src/integrations/hooks.ts#L330-L332\r\n\r\nThe two code above belongs to the `createRouteManifest` and `runHookConfigDone` functions respectively. The former always runs first, then the latter. ([example](https://github.com/withastro/astro/blob/0770810aa458192d1d6f14a51a17504885f67644/packages/astro/src/core/build/index.ts#L123-L125), and few other places). Maybe we need to swap the order to fix this, though I'm not sure if it's safe.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2577804981/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/2589751427","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/issues/12803#issuecomment-2589751427","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/12803","id":2589751427,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFL76Q86aXHiD","user":{"login":"gtom84","id":53334241,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMzM0MjQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53334241?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84","html_url":"https://github.com/gtom84","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtom84/repos","events_u